@3:39 100% spoton! One way to get off porn easier is by remembering that every person has a name, smell, desires, personalities so on and so forth.
Before "getting it on" to a chosen video, imagine what the person's actual name is, what he/she smells like, what its hobbies are and such, because it humanizes them so much, which lowers the desire to just getting off to a piece of meat.
It also helps to be less objectifying while going on and about irl, which is so much more satisfying and peacefuller.
